const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文研究较长样本中的美国股票市场整体价差、深度和交易活动，以及它们随市场与宏观条件的变化。 阅读时应把它理解为受样本、时点和制度限定的问题，而不是可以脱离条件的结论。",en:"The article studies aggregate U.S. equity-market spreads, depth, and trading activity over an extended sample, including their variation with market and macro conditions. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00335",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2001) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2001) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"它聚合日度市场指标，并把其变化与市场涨跌、波动、日历效应、利率和已安排宏观公告关联。 比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系共同构成研究合同；改变其中一项，可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It aggregates daily market measures and relates their changes to market direction, volatility, calendar effects, rates, and scheduled macroeconomic announcements. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00335",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2001) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2001) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"需要日度报价价差、深度、活动度量、证券构成与聚合权重、交易日历、利率序列和带时点的公告事件。 字段定义、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原研究分别记录，不能仅因变量同名或使用最新修订值就视为可比。",en:"Required inputs are daily quoted spreads, depth, activity measures, security composition and aggregation weights, a trading calendar, rate series, and dated announcement events. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00335",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2001) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2001) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"摘要报告流动性与活动的时间变化和共同变动，而不是认为单一日度代理变量穷尽交易成本或压力。 它只支持来源所描述的经验或理论关系，不能把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"Its abstract reports time variation and joint movement in market liquidity and activity; it does not say that any one daily proxy exhausts trading cost or stress. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not turn association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00335",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2001) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2001) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"冻结样本与聚合规则；让报价和成交落在同一交易时段；明确停牌、成员变化、异常值、利率口径和事件时钟。 开展后续分析前，应将这些选择写入版本化研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Freeze the universe and aggregation rule; align quotes and trades to the same session; keep halts, membership changes, outliers, rate conventions, and event clocks explicit. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00335",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2001) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2001) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 The Journal of Finance (2001)。美国整体样本及其制度时期不等于实时流动性信号，也不自动证明对其他场所的可迁移因果效应。 如需数值结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites The Journal of Finance (2001). The U.S. aggregate sample and its institutional period do not establish a real-time liquidity signal or a portable causal effect for another venue. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00335",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2001) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2001) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Market Liquidity and Trading Activity”公开说明的研究对象与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。美国整体样本及其制度时期不等于实时流动性信号，也不自动证明对其他场所的可迁移因果效应。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Market Liquidity and Trading Activity”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
